exists su name agent-helper be mind via state "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" from discourse "You are concise." ya

su name agent tools be map def
su name agent ob bool truth ya
su name session name ob text "draft review" ya
su name read from filename be can do
su name write ob text to filename be can do
prah

su name prompt ob text "Say hello in one short sentence." for name agent-helper to name text agent-out with name agent tools be write do
